### Testes rapidos da API (IntelliJ HTTP Client ou extensao REST Client do VS Code)
@base = http://localhost:8080

### Status da API
GET {{base}}/

### Operadoras
GET {{base}}/operadoras

### Cadastrar usuario
POST {{base}}/usuarios
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nome": "Enzo Leiva", "cpf": "529.982.247-25", "email": "enzo@email.com", "saldoPontos": 2000 }

### Creditar pontos SoulUp
PATCH {{base}}/usuarios/1/pontos
Content-Type: application/json

{ "pontos": 500 }

### Converter pontos em voucher
POST {{base}}/vouchers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "usuarioId": 1, "operadoraId": 1, "pontos": 800 }

### Usar o voucher na catraca (troque o codigo pelo que voltou acima)
POST {{base}}/viagens
Content-Type: application/json

{ "codigoVoucher": "COLE-O-CODIGO-AQUI", "modal": "ONIBUS", "distanciaKm": 12.5 }

### Painel do usuario
GET {{base}}/usuarios/1/resumo

### Impacto geral
GET {{base}}/impacto
